 "name": "ST47EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "Kamille",
  "\"Gravity... it's really something...!\"",
  "The AEUG fleet",
  "that had attacked Green Noa,",
  "joined by the Federation fleets",
  "that had answered its call,",
  "descended upon Jaburo.",
  "Its strength, counted",
  "in mobile suits,",
  "was reportedly some 70 to 80.",
  "That was several times",
  "what Char had brought when he",
  "attacked Jaburo once before.",
  "Yet as a force",
  "to annihilate Jaburo,",
  "it was small indeed.",
  "\"So Jaburo's military facilities",
  " lie somewhere beyond here?\"",
  "Quattro",
  "(Strange. Jaburo's resistance",
  " should be far fiercer than this.",
  " What's going on?)",
  "\"Let's go. There should be",
  " a first line of defense.\"",
  "\"Yes, ma'am!\"",
  "The commander,",
  "Char Aznable,",
  "told his sponsors his forces",
  "were too few, but AEUG leaders,",
  "prizing political victory above",
  "all, forced the operation through.",
  "As a result, Char once again",
  "left an odd name in history: the",
  "commander to attack Jaburo twice.",
  "Named at every turn of history,",
  "he was a man of curious fortune.",
  "The Titans, for their part,",
  "had not left this",
  "unanswered.",
  "Jamaican Daninghan's fleet",
  "and Paptimus Scirocco, newly",
  "back from Jupiter, would strike",
  "in a two-stage attack at",
  "the AEUG during atmospheric entry,",
  "and whatever got past them",
  "would be blown away by a nuke,",
  "Jaburo and all. Such was the plan.",
  "Of course,",
  "not even the Titans who went in",
  "had been told that",
  "the nuke existed.",
  "Their story would be that, purely",
  "by accident during the fighting,",
  "the stored nukes had detonated.",
  "By rights, the orthodox move",
  "was to crush the landing force",
  "with Jaburo's own strength.",
  "Nor",
  "does it seem that this",
  "was impossible.",
  "If they pressed on to erase",
  "Jaburo regardless, it was surely",
  "because Jamitov judged that, as",
  "the Titans moved to seize power,",
  "a symbol such as Jaburo",
  "would only stand",
  "in their way.",
  "But to the people",
  "fighting on the battlefield,",
  "none of that mattered.",
  "All they could do",
  "was face the death bearing down",
  "on them, desperately.",
  "Jerid",
  "\"Lila's Galbaldy is",
  " nowhere to be found...",
  " That can't be...!\"",
  "\"Why's that Gundam still",
  " so full of fight!?\"",
  "Amid it all, Jerid,",
  "who, during atmospheric entry,",
  "had lost his close friend Kacricon",
  "and the woman he had admired,",
  "Lila Milla Rira,",
  "was likewise",
  "fighting on desperately.",
  "The Grudge of the Earthbound",
  "The Silent Air Defense Net",
  "As the people of space resented",
  "Earth's people over the 30 Bunch",
  "Incident, heavy taxes and poverty,",
  "so Earth's residents, in turn, grew",
  "to hate the people of space more.",
  "The Earth Federation, its economy",
  "and environment ravaged",
  "by the One Year War,",
  "sought to deflect public anger",
  "by pinning the blame",
  "on the people of space.",
  "Of course, had anyone said",
  "their plight was Zeon's doing,",
  "it would",
  "have been true enough.",
  "But the Federation government",
  "aimed hatred, one-sidedly,",
  "not only at Zeon but also",
  "at the Lunarians, and at any",
  "colony that was friendly",
  "to the Federation.",
  "When the economy falters,",
  "stir up the threat",
  "of enemies abroad,",
  "and bind the people together",
  "through hatred and fear.",
  "It is a strong drug failing states",
  "love, and the Federation",
  "government was no exception.",
  "\"The people of space hoard",
  " all the resources and food,",
  " and never lift a finger for",
  " the people of Earth, who suffer",
  " pollution and abnormal weather.",
  " They are egoists.\"",
  "\"The AEUG is",
  " nothing but a cover for Zeon,",
  " an organization that fuels",
  " that very egoism,",
  " and so it must be defeated.\"",
  "Such propaganda",
  "ran daily on the news,",
  "and people swallowed it whole.",
  "Rather than accept that the",
  "government they had supposedly",
  "elected democratically was doing",
  "nothing to help them, caring",
  "only for the interests",
  "of the privileged few,",
  "it was far more comfortable",
  "to think the good Earth Federation",
  "was being menaced",
  "by the evil",
  "people of space.",
  "In this battle,",
  "the Federation Air Force",
  "barely made a move.",
  "In the One Year War,",
  "the air force had performed",
  "quite creditably.",
  "The mobile suits of the day",
  "could only come down from orbit",
  "in bucket-like descent pods,",
  "simply falling",
  "toward the ground,",
  "so they made fine targets",
  "for high-altitude fighters.",
  "Launched from the ground",
  "on boosters,",
  "the pilots who flew",
  "fighters such as the Saberfish",
  "boldly intercepted",
  "the iron giants falling",
  "on their homeland, and from",
  "among them would come",
  "many MS pilots whose names",
  "would later go down in history.",
  "Of course, Minovsky particles",
  "and the mass driver bombardment",
  "that came before the descent",
  "on Earth had wiped out",
  "most of the air defense network,",
  "and sniping with long-range",
  "missiles was a pipe dream,",
  "but with a flier's pride,",
  "skill, and a thirst for revenge,",
  "they downed pod after pod",
  "with their autocannons.",
  "Even the crude tactic",
  "of strapping a balloon",
  "called a ballute to a mobile suit",
  "and hurling it down",
  "through the atmosphere",
  "was likely born of the nightmares",
  "of Zeon pilots shot down",
  "helplessly as soon as they",
  "entered the atmosphere.",
  "For with a ballute,",
  "a suit could finish cooling",
  "before fighters could climb",
  "into the stratosphere,",
  "then take them on",
  "while in free fall.",
  "Naturally, the air force",
  "did not take it lying down,",
  "fielding new aircraft that adopted",
  "the AMBAC of mobile suits, and",
  "fighters that transformed into MS,",
  "and late in the war, the upper",
  "atmosphere and the stratosphere",
  "saw pilots of humanoid craft",
  "fight fierce battles time and again.",
  "But that is a story for later.",
  "In this battle, the air force",
  "halfheartedly sent up fighters",
  "like the Saberfish and TIN Cod,",
  "and little more;",
  "it achieved next to nothing.",
  "They cared nothing for the Titans",
  "or for the AEUG.",
  "To put it bluntly,",
  "they were deliberately shirking;",
  "that is how it should be seen.",
  "Blatant power struggles",
  "were exactly what they abhorred."
 ]
